  "description": "More power, more trails, more adventure. Our ALLTRAIL 10.5 ABS is the new flagship of our ALLTRAIL series – the perfect choice for those who demand no compromises on their trail adventures. With the brand-new Bosch Performance CX motor and a powerful 800Wh battery, this full-suspension eMTB conquers even the highest alpine paths. The Fox fork, RockShox shock and dropper seatpost deliver world-class performance on the downhills. And when things get tricky, the integrated eBike ABS, which prevents the front wheel from locking on slippery terrain, acts as your bodyguard. Need more range? The optional Range Extender boosts your battery by an additional 250Wh. This eMTB offers the ideal setup for more trails and more adventures – the wilder, the better.",
